  "description": "Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration for Portico, the contract-first CLI framework for .NET. Resolve command contracts and middleware from an IServiceProvider, with one IServiceScope per dispatched command. Command services stay lazy, and scoped resources are disposed after success, failure or cancellation. The core Portico package stays dependency-free; this is the opt-in.",
